I want to resolve a warning reported by NullAway.
I am getting the error that in line:     if (workflow.getWorkflowDefinition().isWorkflowStatusListenerEnabled()) {, the dereferenced expression workflow.getWorkflowDefinition() is @Nullable and can produce Null Pointer Exception. In the method below:
